<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Numerical results obtained by PRISM and baselines for posterior mean estimation.
All values are averaged over the test dataset.
RMSE values are in <math id="S3.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10^{-3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math> units. <span id="S3.T2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> marks best results; <span id="S3.T2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span> numbers indicate second best.</figcaption>
